Recommends: homelab-api, homelab-sso, homelab-webproxy, homelab-audit, homelab-agent
Description: Calendar web app for the homelab-* ecosystem
 calendar.<domain>: calendars with single and repeating events (RFC 5545
 rules, expanded on the server in the event's own time zone), per-occurrence
 edits, sharing to other accounts (see, or see and edit) and by link to
 anyone (everything, or busy times only), a read-only ICS feed per share
 that a phone can subscribe to, and an .ics export with the rules kept.
 .
 A BFF-style Mojolicious app like homelab-drive: browsers talk only to this
 app; sign-in is delegated to homelab-sso and the token is held in this
 app's own session cookie, re-verified against homelab-api on every
 request. Data lives in its own `calendar` Postgres schema (split
 runtime/migrate roles). The FullCalendar MIT bundle is shipped with the
 package and served by the app itself; nothing is loaded from a CDN.
